  'manager.match.big_win': 'What a performance! Absolutely dominant — keep this up!|That\'s how we do it! Clinical from start to finish.|Brilliant! The squad were outstanding today.|Couldn\'t have asked for more — that\'s the standard we set now.',
  'manager.match.win': 'Three points in the bag! Great work from the players.|Job done. Not pretty but we\'ll take the win.|Hard-fought but we deserved it. Keep pushing.|That\'s what we want — grinding out results. Well done.|Character shown today. Three points is three points.',
  'manager.match.close_win': 'Phew! Squeaky bum time but we got the result.|Narrow wins like these win leagues! That\'s a massive three points.|Didn\'t do it the easy way but who cares — we won!',
  'manager.match.win_injury': 'Great result, but we\'re going to miss {name} while they recover.|Bittersweet — brilliant win but losing {name} hurts. Hope it\'s not too serious.',
  'manager.match.draw': 'A point is a point — we move on. We need to be more clinical.|Frustrating. We had chances to win that. Must do better.|Could\'ve been three points. We\'ll regroup and go again.|Not the result we wanted but at least we didn\'t lose.',
  'manager.match.close_loss': 'So close... Frustrating, but we\'ll bounce back.|That one hurts. A bit more composure and we\'d have had it.|Unlucky today — we played well enough to get something from that.|Fine margins. We\'re not far off.',
  'manager.match.heavy_loss': 'That wasn\'t good enough. We need to look at this seriously.|Can\'t sugar-coat it — that was a bad day. We go again.|Not acceptable. Time to take a hard look at the squad.|We were well beaten. Heads up — use it as motivation.',
  'manager.match.injury_only': 'Tough news about {name} — we\'ll have to manage without them for a while.|Losing {name} to injury is a real blow. Hope they\'re back soon.',
  'manager.cup.win_trophy': 'WE\'VE WON IT! 🏆 You\'ve lifted the cup — this is a season the fans will never forget!|CHAMPIONS! Absolute history made today. I\'m so proud of this team!',
  'manager.cup.loss_final': 'So close to glory... losing in the final is the worst feeling in football. But look what we achieved to get here — hold your heads up.|A final defeat cuts deep. We\'ll be back. We\'ll be back.',
  'manager.cup.win_semi': 'WE\'RE IN THE FINAL! 🎉 What a night — now one more to lift the cup!|Brilliant! A spot in the final is what we\'ve dreamed of. Rest up, the biggest game of the season is next.',
  'manager.cup.loss_semi': 'Semi-final heartbreak. We were 90 minutes from the final. That one will sting for a while.|So painful — semi-finals are the cruellest losses. Good cup run, though, don\'t forget that.',
  'manager.cup.big_win': 'Cup night demolition! That\'ll put fear into the rest of the tournament.|Ruthless. We\'re a real force in this cup now.',
  'manager.cup.close_win': 'Knockout football! Doesn\'t matter how — we\'re THROUGH!|A cup tie won by the finest of margins. Get the players on a victory lap.',
  'manager.cup.win': 'Good cup win — onto the next round!|Progression secured. One step closer to the trophy.',
  'manager.cup.close_loss': 'Out of the cup by a single goal — brutal. Fine margins separate you from the trophy.|A knockout loss is always painful. We were close, but close isn\'t enough in this competition.',
  'manager.cup.heavy_loss': 'Cup run\'s over and we got taught a lesson. Back to the league, dust yourselves off.|Well beaten on a big stage. That\'s the cup for you — no second chances. We move on.',
  'coach.match.head.halftime': 'Half time, gaffer.|Right, dressing room talk.|Forty-five gone. Listen up.|Half time. Quick word.|Tea-break thoughts.|Boot-room verdict at the break.|Whistle\'s gone — here\'s the read.',
  'coach.match.head.live': '{mins}\', listen up.|{mins}\' on the clock — a thought.|Quick word, {mins}\'.|Pay attention, {mins}\'.|From the touchline, {mins}\'.|{mins}\' — earpiece check.',
  'coach.match.ht.level': 'All square. Plenty to play for second half.|Honours even. Whoever scores next changes everything.|Goalless — but we\'ve got more in the tank.|Locked at level. Need a moment of quality.|Even game. Sharper in the final third after the break.',
  'coach.match.ht.lead_big': 'Cruising at the break. Don\'t get sloppy.|Two-goal cushion. Manage the second half.|Comfortable. Keep concentration high.|Healthy lead — see it out, no daft mistakes.',
  'coach.match.ht.lead_one': 'Nose ahead at the break. One more would settle nerves.|Slim lead. Stay compact early in the second.|Up by one. Don\'t sit too deep.|Lead\'s there — guard it, then build on it.',
  'coach.match.ht.behind_big': 'Chasing the game. Big response needed.|Two down. Rip up the script second half.|Battered first half. Show some pride now.|Heavy work ahead. Throw caution out.',
  'coach.match.ht.behind_one': 'One down at the break. Plenty of time.|Behind, but only just. One goal flips it.|Trailing — but we\'ve not been outplayed.|Need a quick start to the second.',
  'coach.match.early_level': 'Early days. Settle in, feel them out.|Easy does it. Find our rhythm.|Still warming up. Keep shape.|Don\'t force it yet.',
  'coach.match.battered': 'We\'re getting battered. Throw bodies forward.|This is grim. Need to take risks now.|Two down — kitchen sink time.|Backs to the wall. Go for broke.',
  'coach.match.behind_one_early': 'One down — plenty of time. Squeeze them high.|Behind, but loads of game left. Press them.|One goal swing — push up.|Trailing. Tempo up, don\'t panic.',
  'coach.match.behind_one_late': 'Time\'s running out. We have to chase it.|Clock\'s ticking — go after them.|Need a goal, sharpish.|Risk it. Lose by two beats lose by one if we level.',
  'coach.match.level_early': 'Even game. Stay patient, keep shape.|Level — keep the ball, wait for the gap.|Tight. One moment will decide it.|Stalemate. Don\'t get drawn into chaos.',
  'coach.match.level_late': 'Still level. Whoever blinks first loses it.|Late and level. Be brave on the ball.|Draw\'s no good if we\'re chasing the league.|Push for a winner — carefully.',
  'coach.match.lead_one_early': 'Nose in front. No need to overcommit yet.|Up by one. Stay disciplined.|Lead\'s a start. Now build on it.|One in front — keep doing what\'s working.',
  'coach.match.lead_one_late': 'Lead\'s thin. Don\'t gift them a sniff.|Game-management time. Kill the tempo.|Hold it together. Final third matters most.|Five-minute spells of pressure — ride them out.',
  'coach.match.lead_big_early': 'Comfortable, but don\'t switch off.|Two-goal lead — keep the foot down.|Sit on the lead and we\'ll regret it. Press on.|Good shape, good lead. Stay sharp.',
  'coach.match.lead_big_late': 'Comfortable. Keep shape, see it out.|Game\'s won — don\'t let it get spicy.|Manage the clock. Smart fouls if needed.|Closing it out. Don\'t switch off.',
  'coach.match.try_strategy': 'Try {name}.|Switch to {name}.|Roll with {name}.|Go {name} — now.|{name} is the move.',
  'coach.match.try.balanced': 'Let\'s steady it — {name}.|Back to {name} and hold our shape.|{name}. Stop chasing the game.|Settle it down: {name}.|{name} — play our own game again.',
  'coach.match.try.allOutAttack': 'Everyone forward — {name}.|{name}. Kitchen sink at them.|We need a goal: {name}.|Gamble now — {name}.|{name}, and damn the consequences.',
  'coach.match.try.parkTheBus': 'See it out — {name}.|{name}. Men behind the ball.|Shut it down: {name}.|Protect this — {name}.|{name}. Not another chance, not one.',
  'coach.match.try.counterAttack': 'Sit in and break — {name}.|{name}. Let them come onto us.|Soak it up and hit them fast: {name}.|{name} — catch them on the turn.|Invite them on: {name}.',
  'coach.match.try.highPress': 'Press them — {name}.|{name}. Get after it high up.|Squeeze up: {name}.|{name} — win it back in their half.|Hunt it down. {name}.',
