  'coach.label': 'Coach Colin',
  'coachtip.name': 'Coach Colin',
  'coachtip.tap_dismiss': 'Tap to continue',
  'coachtip.injury.title': 'One of your players is hurt',
  'coachtip.injury.body': 'An injured player drags down your squad rating and earns less. Head to your Squad and sub them out until they recover.',
  'coachtip.injury.cta': 'Go to Squad',
  'coachtip.loss.title': 'Tough one, gaffer',
  'coachtip.loss.body': 'Can\'t win \'em all. Remember: playing at home gives you a +5 rating boost — check your squad rating before kickoff and rest anyone injured.',
  'coachtip.promotion.title': 'Promoted! 🎉',
  'coachtip.promotion.body': 'Finish near the top and you climb to the next division — tougher rivals, but bigger payouts and more silverware for the trophy cabinet.',
  'coachtip.merge.title': 'How to merge',
  'coachtip.merge.body': 'You have two of the same player! To merge, press and hold one and drag it onto its twin for a stronger, higher-tier card. But hold off for now — build a full team of 11 first, then start merging up.',
  'coachtip.energy.title': 'You\'re out of energy',
  'coachtip.energy.body': 'Energy refills on its own — one pip every few minutes. In a hurry? Watch an ad or grab a refill in the Shop to get back on the pitch.',
  'coachtip.fatigue.title': 'Players tire in Pro mode',
  'coachtip.fatigue.body': 'See the little bar under each player? That\'s their match fitness. Every game drains it, and a tired player rates lower than a fresh one. It refills on its own over real time, so rest a tired star on the bench and they\'ll be fresh for the next big match.',
  'coachtip.match_fitness.title': 'Your XI is tiring',
  'coachtip.match_fitness.body': 'That fitness % on the Play button is your starting eleven\'s average — it drops as they play. You get 5 subs a match: bring on fresh legs when someone\'s flagging, and replace anyone who gets injured. Spend them wisely though — if you\'re all out of subs when a player goes down, you finish the match a man down at 10.',
  'coachtip.subs_bench.title': 'You have a bench',
  'coachtip.subs_bench.body': 'Tap Subs during a match to open your bench — you get 5 swaps a game, and the clock stops while you pick. Injuries go there too now: when someone goes down their shirt comes off the pitch and stays empty until you bring a replacement on, so don\'t leave them to it.',
  'coachtip.club_assets.title': 'Welcome to your club',
  'coachtip.club_assets.body': 'This is your club HQ. Buy assets like the Stadium and Training Ground here — each one boosts your match income or squad. Place them, then upgrade as the money rolls in.',
  'coachtip.training.title': 'Train for free',
  'coachtip.training.body': 'Training mini-games pay out coins and cost no energy — perfect when you\'re waiting to play. Each has its own cooldown, so work round the rota.',
  'coachtip.rename_player.title': 'Name them yourself',
  'coachtip.rename_player.body': 'Don\'t fancy the names they came with? Tap any player on the Squad tab, then the pencil — call them whatever you like. It\'s cosmetic only, so rating, income and merging all stay exactly as they were.',
  'coachtip.customise_manager.title': 'That\'s you down there',
  'coachtip.customise_manager.body': 'The figure pacing the touchline on the Play screen is you. Tap CUSTOMISE underneath to sort your build, kit, hair and face — and there\'s more to unlock as your Fan Zone grows and the trophies come in.',
  'coachtip.traits.title': 'Players have traits',
  'coachtip.traits.body': 'Some players carry special traits — extra rating, more income, fewer injuries. Tap a player to see theirs, or roll for new ones to build a dream team.',
  'coachtip.atk_def.title': 'ATK vs DEF',
  'coachtip.atk_def.body': 'Your squad rating is Attack + Defence. ATK wins you goals, DEF stops theirs. A balanced side beats a lopsided one — keep an eye on both.',
  'coachtip.auto_sell.title': 'Sick of selling bronze?',
  'coachtip.auto_sell.body': 'At this level half of what we scout isn\'t worth a squad number, boss. In Settings → Gameplay, Auto-Sell Tiers lets you tick off the tiers you\'re done with — those players get cashed in the moment they\'re found, no trip to the Squad tab. World Class and Icon can never be auto-sold, so the big ones are safe.',
  'coachtip.auto_sell.cta': 'Set up Auto-Sell',
  'coachtip.try_hard_mode.title': 'Fancy a challenge?',
  'coachtip.try_hard_mode.body': 'You\'ve come a long way, boss. Ready for Pro mode? Players tire during matches, so rotating the squad and working the bench actually matters — tap Auto and I\'ll pick your freshest legal XI for you — and I\'ll stay quiet on tactics. It starts a fresh team — only if you\'re up for it.',
  'coachtip.try_hard_mode.cta': 'Open Settings',
  'coachtip.sponsor.title': 'A sponsor wants in',
  'coachtip.sponsor.body': 'A company wants to sponsor one of your players — good income boost. They come with a small catch though, so don\'t just say yes to everything. Don\'t worry, I\'ll help you decide.',
