  'coach.hard.press_risk': 'High Press spikes injury risk — risky with tired legs. Worth it vs {opp}?',
  'coach.hard.rest_easy': '{opp} look beatable — a good chance to rest your tired players.',
  'coach.hard.rotate': 'The squad\'s looking tired. Rotate some legs before results start slipping.',
  'manager.grudge': '⚠️ {opp} hold a grudge — they\'ll be fired up today. Expect a tough game.',
  'manager.relegation_battle': '{opp} are fighting for survival — expect desperation from the first whistle.|{opp} are deep in a relegation battle. Cornered teams are dangerous.|Don\'t underestimate {opp} — they\'ve got everything to play for. Nothing to lose.|{opp} need points badly. They\'ll come out swinging — be ready.',
  'manager.rating_gap_higher': '⚠️ {opp} are the better side. Merge stronger players or tactics will need to do the talking.',
  'manager.rating_gap_lower': '📈 {opp} are rated well below us — prime chance for three points.',
  'manager.rotate_hard': '📉 {opp} are well below us — rest a star or two and bank their fitness for the games that matter.',
  'manager.lucky_boot': '🍀 Lucky Boot\'s on, boss — they\'ll play {n}% below their level today. Go and win this one.',
  'manager.default_tip': 'Keep merging players into higher tiers to boost your squad rating.',
  'squadstate.few_players': 'Only a handful of players on the books. Squad rating needs 11 — scout more players, boss.|We can\'t field an XI with this. Grab a few more players in the shop before matchday.|Thin doesn\'t cover it — we need a squad of eleven. Plenty of coin to scout more, get it done.',
  'squadstate.low_energy': 'Running low on energy, boss — watch an ad for a top-up before kickoff.|Squad\'s half-knackered. Get the energy bar up before we head out.|No energy, no match. Quick top-up and we\'re away.',
  'squadstate.poor_form': 'A few players are in rough form. A win would settle them down.|Dressing room\'s a bit flat — too many out of form. Win this and the mood shifts.|Form\'s an issue across the squad right now. Get a result and confidence comes back quick.',
  'squadstate.form_high': 'We\'re flying. Keep this run going and promotion\'s a real shout.|Proper run of form. Don\'t let up — top two is in sight.|Confidence is sky-high after those wins. Keep playing the way we are.|Six in ten isn\'t bad, gaffer. Squad\'s believing. Keep it going.',
  'squadstate.run_in': 'Just {n} matches left — every point matters now.|Run-in time. {n} to go, no room for slip-ups.|Final stretch, boss. Make these {n} count.',
  'squadstate.run_in_one': 'Just one match left — every point matters now.|Run-in time. One to go, no room for slip-ups.|Final stretch, boss. Make this one count.',
  'squadstate.weak_higher': 'Squad\'s weaker than most in this league — merge bronze into silver when you can, or the tough fixtures will bite.|We\'re undercooked for this division. Push on with the merging, otherwise the big matches will get away.|Honest truth — we\'re outgunned by most teams here. Get some silvers in before the tough half of the fixtures.',
  'squadstate.weak_lower': 'We\'re outgunned right now. Keep merging and building the squad.|Tough division for where we are. Grind out results and keep developing.|Gap to the top teams is real. Merge what you\'ve got and stay competitive.',
  'squadstate.bronze_heavy': 'Most of the squad\'s still bronze. Three of the same player merges to silver — proper jump in quality.|Bronze-heavy side. A few merges into silver and we look a different team.|Start-of-season priority: get some silvers out of that bronze pile.',
  'squadstate.assets_t1': 'Club facilities are still basic. Upgrade the stadium or training ground and you\'ll feel it on matchday.|Tier-one assets all round. An upgrade or two in the club and we\'d lift a few ratings without signing a soul.|Club infrastructure\'s lagging the squad. Any asset upgrade helps on the pitch.',
  'squadstate.thin_squad': 'Thin squad, boss. Scout a few more so we\'ve got options off the bench.|Not enough bodies in the dressing room. More players means more merges.|Depth\'s light. Scout more — injuries will come.',
  'squadstate.season_start': 'Fresh season in the {div}. Start strong — early momentum carries.|New season. Set the tone early, boss.|First match of the year. Let\'s kick off on the front foot.',
  'squadstate.strong': 'Squad\'s stronger than most teams in this division. Top two is there for the taking.|We outrate the rest of this league. Push for promotion — the quality\'s there.|On paper we\'re the best here. Play like it.',
  'cup.tip.low_energy': 'Low on energy — top up before the cup tie, there\'s no second chance in knockout.|Can\'t play a cup tie on an empty tank — get that energy bar up first.|Knockout football\'s tough enough without starting drained. Sort the energy, then kick off.',
  'cup.tip.poor_form': 'Several players are in poor form heading into the cup — a misfiring side in knockout football is a risky bet.|Half the squad\'s out of form. Cup day\'s not the day to find your rhythm — win a couple of league games first if you can.|Form worries heading into the cup. A bad day here and the run\'s over.',
  'cup.tip.generic_round': 'Cup Round',
  'cup.tip.final': 'This is the final. Win it and the trophy\'s yours — plus a big sponsor drop. One match, 90 minutes, everything on the line.|Finals aren\'t won on paper. Stick to what we do, trust the squad, and the cabinet gets another trophy tonight.|No second chances from here. Lift that cup and the fans talk about this season for years.|Final day. Nerves are normal — just don\'t let them cost us the first fifteen. Start strong.|90 minutes from immortality. Whatever it takes — a 1-0 scrap is as good as a 5-0 win.|Biggest match of the season. Sponsors are watching, scouts are watching, half the neutrals are watching. Give \'em a show.',
  'cup.tip.semi': 'Semi-final day — win and you\'re one match from the trophy. These sides are stronger than anything in the league, so expect a real fight.|Semis are where cup runs die. Focused, disciplined, no silly mistakes — that\'s how we get to the final.|One more and we\'re in the final. The opposition will throw everything at us — weather the storm, then strike.|90 minutes from a final. Treat it like the biggest league match of the season, only louder.|Semi-final. The quality steps up from here — pick the eleven who\'ve earned it, leave nothing in the tank.',
  'cup.tip.opener': 'Cup {round} — lose and you\'re out for the season. These are better sides than our league opponents, so treat it like a top-of-table tie.|Cup opener. One bad afternoon and the run\'s over — don\'t be fooled by the early stage, they won\'t make it easy.|First round of the cup. Everyone starts fresh here — form and league position count for nothing once the whistle goes.|Cup day. Strong side out, no experiments — we can rotate in the league next weekend.|Welcome to the cup. Expect a step up in quality from what we\'re used to in the league. Be ready.|Knockout football starts here. Lose and it\'s back to the league grind for another year — win and the ride begins.',
  'cup.tip.middle': '{round} — knockout football. Lose and the cup run ends here. Keep your best XI healthy for the next round.|{round} day. Deeper we go, tougher they get. Focus\'s everything now.|Another cup tie, another knockout. Don\'t overthink it — we got here by playing our football.|{round}. Manage the minutes, watch the injuries — a deep cup run means nothing if we can\'t field a team in the league.',
